{"file_id":"BRIEFING_MISSION_BLOCK_381E50","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Boss……我在想，靠Fulton到处招兵，\n会不会也太强硬了？\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"事到如今你还说什么。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":31,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"比起这样，招募志愿兵更现实。\n我们虽不是公司组织，但从规模来看，\n已经可以算是大企业了。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":129,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"总不能永远用游击式的方法\n继续招募士兵吧。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":62,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"要招募志愿兵，就从菜单里\n选择<R=『RECRUIT』,RECRUIT>。\n","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=『RECRUIT』,RECRUIT>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"另外，选择<R=『TRADE』,TRADE>的话，\n还可以和其他雇佣兵部队交换士兵。\n","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=『TRADE』,TRADE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":95,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"前提是你有那样的<R=“潜友”,FRIEND>啊。\n","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=“潜友”,FRIEND>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"}]}